Fonts:

No font binary is committed to this repository. `make fonts` downloads the
free, openly-licensed faces (OFL 1.1 / Apache) from Fontsource at build time,
into the gitignored assets/fonts/: Inter, Geist, Geist Mono, JetBrains Mono,
Plus Jakarta Sans, Hanken Grotesk, Archivo, Caveat, Space Grotesk, Instrument
Serif (all OFL 1.1).

Sohne (Klim Type Foundry) is a paid face and is never distributed. It is
used locally only for brand-fidelity captures; supply your own copy at
assets/fonts/local/Sohne.woff2.

Icon and photo sources:

- Brand logos: Simple Icons (simpleicons.org), CC0. A handful of these SVGs
  are committed under assets/icons/ because local demos load them. CC0
  covers the icon file, not the trademark: a company mark stays that
  company's mark.

- Flags: flagcdn.com, public domain. Fetched on demand, not committed.

- Photos: CC0 / CC-BY via the photo fetcher; CC-BY credits are recorded per
  video. Fetched on demand, not committed.

Sound effects:

Every cue is synthesized from parameters by `make audio` (core/audio/kit.mjs):
no download, no license, byte-identical on every machine. A real sample is an
optional OVERRIDE, never a replacement.

- `make sfx-pack` fetches Kenney's "Interface Sounds" pack, Creative Commons
  Zero (CC0, public domain): "free to use in personal, educational and
  commercial projects", https://kenney.nl/assets/interface-sounds. Fetched on
  demand into the gitignored assets/sfx/, not committed.

- `make sfx-local DIR=<path>` maps sound files YOU already downloaded onto
  the engine's cue names, via harness/media/sfx-local-map.json. The owner's
  preferred source is soundeffect-lab.info, whose terms permit commercial use
  with no credit but prohibit redistribution; this repo never fetches from
  that site, only maps files you already have on disk.

See engine-doctrine/ASSET-SOURCES.md for the fuller list of stock media
sources, with each one's own license verified.

Never distributed:

- Sohne (see Fonts above): a paid face, bring-your-own copy only.

- Resource Boy gradient pack (assets/gradients/) and the Ransom letter
